{
  "batch_id": "s1:batch:0017",
  "translations": [
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01273",
      "en": "Ah, then I'll have the same as Master...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01275",
      "en": "Just Shuri's typical response.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01282",
      "en": "I see, huh.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01284",
      "en": "Rinsha nodded slowly, then",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01285",
      "en": "elbowed my back and walked to the kitchen.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01292",
      "en": "?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01299",
      "en": "Soon after, Rinsha returned with three meals.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01302",
      "en": "I haven't eaten yet. Can I join you?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01304",
      "en": "She said that while placing three dishes on the table.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01307",
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01310",
      "en": "Thanks.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01312",
      "en": "As I answered, she gave a brisk smile,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01313",
      "en": "sat down across from me,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01314",
      "en": "and fired off rapid questions...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01317",
      "en": "So what brought you two to this town?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01320",
      "en": "Recuperation.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01323",
      "en": "Oh, but earlier, by my place with Levia,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01324",
      "en": "weren't you talking?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01327",
      "en": "Does Levia come here often?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01330",
      "en": "Yeah, she's a regular. Just as I thought...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01333",
      "en": "What do you mean?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01336",
      "en": "So the man who never showed up was you, Celica.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01339",
      "en": "Did Levia say that?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:01342",
      "en": "Yeah, she was mad: 'What do you think the mission is?'",
      "notes": ""
    }
  ],
